8175
00:02:04,077 --> 00:02:05,097
iu

8176
00:02:11,677 --> 00:02:14,007
Place where you Belong

8177
00:02:23,727 --> 00:02:24,767
What's this?

8178
00:02:24,897 --> 00:02:26,607
Just what's with this destructive power...?

8179
00:02:39,957 --> 00:02:41,407
This won't do anythingâ€”

8180
00:02:41,537 --> 00:02:43,827
Sinbad! Use your Djinn's Power!

8181
00:02:44,227 --> 00:02:45,487
There is no other option!

8182
00:02:45,687 --> 00:02:49,267
We either kill them, or get killed.

8183
00:02:49,767 --> 00:02:50,407
No,

8184
00:02:50,887 --> 00:02:52,687
there's still another way.

8185
00:02:52,687 --> 00:02:53,327
What?!

8186
00:02:54,047 --> 00:02:55,407
That demon is probably

8187
00:02:55,527 --> 00:02:58,327
keeping the humans alive connected to his core,

8188
00:02:58,547 --> 00:03:01,247
and using their Magoi as a base to move around.

8189
00:03:02,807 --> 00:03:04,827
The core is most likely in his chest.

8190
00:03:05,057 --> 00:03:07,397
If you destroy that in a single strike,

8191
00:03:07,427 --> 00:03:09,647
you could save those three.

8192
00:03:30,717 --> 00:03:31,297
Alright!

8193
00:03:33,107 --> 00:03:34,547
Bararaqâ€”

8194
00:03:34,677 --> 00:03:35,337
What?

8195
00:03:48,267 --> 00:03:49,987
Greetings, everyone!

8196
00:03:50,527 --> 00:03:52,867
Without this, you're powerless now, aren't you?

8197
00:03:53,357 --> 00:03:54,947
The magician, Falan.

8198
00:03:58,907 --> 00:04:00,197
So it was you who was behind this!

8199
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:06,327
Yes, my real body is in Partevia right now,

8200
00:04:06,667 --> 00:04:10,547
In fact, I'm working as a direct magician under Lieutenant General Barbarossa-sama!

8201
00:04:11,087 --> 00:04:12,007
Big-Brother's?

8202
00:04:12,467 --> 00:04:14,337
Captain Dragul...

8203
00:04:15,087 --> 00:04:18,467
My bad, I forgot that you were promoted by two ranks and have now become a Lieutenant.

8204
00:04:18,607 --> 00:04:20,427
Me promotd by two ranks?

8205
00:04:21,097 --> 00:04:22,307
What are you talking about?

8206
00:04:23,307 --> 00:04:27,567
It means, you're already considered as someone who died in action, Junior!

8207
00:04:27,587 --> 00:04:29,937
That voice, is it Big-Brother?

8208
00:04:30,397 --> 00:04:33,437
Failed in clearing the First Dungeon...

8209
00:04:33,567 --> 00:04:37,697
And, still not able to capture the guy who cleared it.

8210
00:04:38,277 --> 00:04:42,237
It's a disgrace that can't be pardoned in the noble family of Dragul.

8211
00:04:42,687 --> 00:04:43,427
Besides...

8212
00:04:43,427 --> 00:04:45,427
it's about my wife.

8213
00:04:47,917 --> 00:04:51,187
Like hell I wouldn't notice,

8214
00:04:51,827 --> 00:04:54,047
that you have feelings for Serendine!

8215
00:04:55,927 --> 00:04:57,727
You were getting a bit too close to her.

8216
00:04:57,907 --> 00:04:59,587
She's my property.

8217
00:05:00,137 --> 00:05:01,807
Know your place,

8218
00:05:01,807 --> 00:05:03,307
and die like a grunt.

8219
00:05:04,427 --> 00:05:07,347
Both you and them are nothing but sacrificial pawns.

8220
00:05:07,727 --> 00:05:10,147
You have nowhere to return to.

8221
00:05:14,317 --> 00:05:15,317
Drakon!

8222
00:05:18,527 --> 00:05:19,317
Hina!

8223
00:05:21,827 --> 00:05:25,327
You should've killed the demon with this sword 
while you had the chance!

8224
00:05:27,117 --> 00:05:28,207
Don't make me repeat myself!

8225
00:05:28,997 --> 00:05:30,287
I am not gonna...

8226
00:05:31,227 --> 00:05:32,447
...abandon anyone here!

8227
00:05:38,967 --> 00:05:40,467
<i>Sinbad...</i>

8228
00:05:40,847 --> 00:05:42,597
<i>...you've always been like that.</i>

8229
00:05:43,427 --> 00:05:46,387
<i>Always trying to achieve something 
with your strong determination.</i>

8230
00:05:47,387 --> 00:05:48,667
<i>I thought I could too,</i>

8231
00:05:49,147 --> 00:05:51,907
<i>become someone like that if I had the King's Power.</i>

8232
00:05:52,227 --> 00:05:54,147
<i>But, now I can tell very clearly.</i>

8233
00:05:54,727 --> 00:05:56,287
<i>Even with that power,</i>

8234
00:05:56,287 --> 00:05:58,487
<i>I can't become someone like you.</i>

8235
00:05:58,857 --> 00:06:00,587
<i>Without admiting that,</i>

8236
00:06:00,967 --> 00:06:02,987
<i>I was just running away.</i>

8237
00:06:04,157 --> 00:06:06,157
It's alright now, Sinbad!

8238
00:06:09,577 --> 00:06:11,877
I said...

8239
00:06:12,627 --> 00:06:14,747
...it's alright now!!

8240
00:06:17,167 --> 00:06:18,047
Hina?!

8241
00:06:18,417 --> 00:06:19,297
Geez...

8242
00:06:19,717 --> 00:06:22,087
I always end up getting in trouble, 
whenever I'm with you.

8243
00:06:22,847 --> 00:06:25,967
Always sticking your nose in matters 
that don't concern you.

8244
00:06:26,517 --> 00:06:29,347
Like snatching my kill on that Rampaging Unicorn 
of your own accord.

8245
00:06:29,347 --> 00:06:32,097
And following me into the Dungeon, 
when no one even asked you to!

8246
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:33,977
Even now,

8247
00:06:34,767 --> 00:06:37,567
with that small body that could be crushed so easily.

8248
00:06:39,277 --> 00:06:40,027
But...

8249
00:06:41,237 --> 00:06:43,567
...you're definitely an amazing guy.

8250
00:06:44,267 --> 00:06:45,267
Iâ€”I see...

8251
00:06:47,037 --> 00:06:48,467
I'm sure someone like you,

8252
00:06:48,707 --> 00:06:50,467
is what they call a King's Vessel.

8253
00:06:51,327 --> 00:06:53,457
Sin, leave that guy to me!

8254
00:06:53,837 --> 00:06:56,457
I am the only one who can take him on right now.

8255
00:06:57,457 --> 00:06:58,227
I know.

8256
00:06:58,507 --> 00:07:01,167
Then, I'll keep him busy until then.

8257
00:07:03,217 --> 00:07:05,677
I'll finish it with this one strike!

8258
00:07:06,887 --> 00:07:09,387
Buzzing around like flies... what an eyesore!

8259
00:07:16,897 --> 00:07:17,397
What!?

8260
00:07:17,937 --> 00:07:18,847
He is...

8261
00:07:18,967 --> 00:07:21,267
...evading the attacks entirely!

8262
00:07:22,027 --> 00:07:24,277
It's as if he could see the flow...

8263
00:07:24,737 --> 00:07:25,277
If that's the case,

8264
00:07:28,767 --> 00:07:29,737
Sinbad!

8265
00:07:30,707 --> 00:07:32,037
Don't, I'm fineâ€”

8266
00:07:32,917 --> 00:07:33,747
But...

8267
00:07:34,037 --> 00:07:36,327
Don't move, we have to finish this in a single strike.

8268
00:07:39,007 --> 00:07:41,667
Your kindheartedness will kill you.

8269
00:07:44,587 --> 00:07:45,587
Die!

8270
00:07:50,597 --> 00:07:51,477
Drakon!

8271
00:07:54,057 --> 00:07:56,227
Until now, I've fought for my country.

8272
00:07:56,937 --> 00:08:00,107
I even thought that it'd be a pleasure 
to die for my country.

8273
00:08:00,527 --> 00:08:01,747
But I was wrong.

8274
00:08:02,697 --> 00:08:04,427
What I must protect is...

8275
00:08:04,907 --> 00:08:06,067
<i>Dying will not be forgiven</i>

8276
00:08:06,737 --> 00:08:07,807
Barbarossa,

8277
00:08:08,007 --> 00:08:09,907
I won't be done by the likes of you!

8278
00:08:10,327 --> 00:08:12,657
That's why I'll definitely leave this Dungeon

8279
00:08:12,807 --> 00:08:16,417
and come there to take your head!

8280
00:08:19,547 --> 00:08:21,377
Come back already, you fools!

8281
00:08:21,377 --> 00:08:24,067
You're not fragile enough 
to fall for such phony tricks,

8282
00:08:24,947 --> 00:08:26,387
are you?

8283
00:08:34,597 --> 00:08:37,437
What's up with... these people?

8284
00:08:45,197 --> 00:08:46,447
Sorry for all the waiting!

8285
00:08:46,947 --> 00:08:48,667
This is Imuchakk clan's...

8286
00:08:49,467 --> 00:08:50,807
..."First lance"!

8287
00:08:51,657 --> 00:08:53,787
<i>I'm no longer that guy from before.</i>

8288
00:08:54,457 --> 00:08:55,617
<i>The me now...</i>

8289
00:09:00,587 --> 00:09:01,547
<i>...can finish this!</i>

8290
00:09:16,437 --> 00:09:18,897
Curse you all, how dare you kill myâ€”

8291
00:09:19,227 --> 00:09:20,937
You too, disappear!

8292
00:09:26,397 --> 00:09:27,767
I'll have this back!

8293
00:09:34,247 --> 00:09:36,447
They're breathing...
It looks like we made it in time.

8294
00:09:39,167 --> 00:09:40,187
You're awake!?

8295
00:09:42,447 --> 00:09:43,007
Hey.

8296
00:09:44,007 --> 00:09:45,377
Sinbad...?

8297
00:09:45,967 --> 00:09:47,167
You saved us...?

8298
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:48,427
Are you okay now?

8299
00:09:49,287 --> 00:09:49,967
Yes,

8300
00:09:50,467 --> 00:09:52,387
It's as if some evil spirit flew from my body.

8301
00:09:52,807 --> 00:09:54,387
I feel rather calm now.

8302
00:09:54,847 --> 00:09:56,217
Evil spirit, huh?

8303
00:09:57,647 --> 00:09:59,107
Wâ€”What's this?

8304
00:09:59,767 --> 00:10:06,187
Visit us at
https://kamitranslation.wordpress.com/

8305
00:10:04,317 --> 00:10:05,727
That black thing again...?

8306
00:10:05,817 --> 00:10:06,527
Leader!

8307
00:10:06,777 --> 00:10:07,607
Impossibleâ€”

8308
00:10:10,357 --> 00:10:11,367
The demon is...

8309
00:10:11,987 --> 00:10:13,467
...resurrecting again!

8310
00:10:16,367 --> 00:10:20,567
This time I created it by using just one body 
as it's core for the source of power.

8311
00:10:20,787 --> 00:10:24,537
Besides, it looks like this boy 
had already started falling in depravity.

8312
00:10:25,127 --> 00:10:27,907
The best material you could ask for as a core.

8313
00:10:28,217 --> 00:10:31,047
What? Falling in Depravity?

8314
00:10:31,047 --> 00:10:34,347
This time, this child himself will become the core.

8315
00:10:34,757 --> 00:10:37,367
In other words, defeating this demon,

8316
00:10:37,507 --> 00:10:39,707
means killing this child!

8317
00:10:40,347 --> 00:10:42,267
Now, what will you do?

8318
00:10:48,527 --> 00:10:49,227
Hey,

8319
00:10:49,947 --> 00:10:51,027
What're you planning to do?

8320
00:10:51,567 --> 00:10:53,907
Ah, don't tell me...

8321
00:10:59,507 --> 00:11:01,927
You plan on dragging the kid out from inside?

8322
00:11:02,387 --> 00:11:05,667
Don't! A human body can't handle the strain!

8323
00:11:20,807 --> 00:11:22,407
What is this?

8324
00:11:23,397 --> 00:11:25,517
Something is entering my head on it's own.

8325
00:11:26,977 --> 00:11:29,087
These are this child's memories.

8326
00:11:29,357 --> 00:11:30,487
Right now we've,

8327
00:11:30,647 --> 00:11:33,087
descended into his deep consciousness.

8328
00:11:33,357 --> 00:11:33,967
Baal!

8329
00:11:36,077 --> 00:11:38,117
Master, talk to him!

8330
00:11:38,907 --> 00:11:40,577
We have to save this child at all costs!

8331
00:11:41,037 --> 00:11:43,187
If this continues, he'll fall in depravity

8332
00:11:43,407 --> 00:11:45,347
and will be trapped in an everlasting darkness.

8333
00:12:00,167 --> 00:12:01,467
It hurts...

8334
00:12:02,767 --> 00:12:04,137
I can't take it anymore...

8335
00:12:06,057 --> 00:12:10,397
Where are you... mother... father...?

8336
00:12:15,777 --> 00:12:17,657
Where are you!?

8337
00:12:19,167 --> 00:12:20,167
Hey,

8338
00:12:20,617 --> 00:12:22,407
Stop whining already!

8339
00:12:22,407 --> 00:12:24,497
Stop crying, you wimp!

8340
00:12:27,327 --> 00:12:29,377
I can't take this anymore.

8341
00:12:29,377 --> 00:12:31,297
I want to go home.

8342
00:12:31,297 --> 00:12:33,837
Home? Just where is that place?

8343
00:12:33,837 --> 00:12:35,467
Get out of the box already!

8344
00:12:37,137 --> 00:12:38,727
Didn't we...

8345
00:12:39,427 --> 00:12:41,287
...kill our parents with these hands!

8346
00:12:43,477 --> 00:12:45,517
Kill them, Ja'far!

8347
00:12:45,977 --> 00:12:46,977
Kill them!

8348
00:12:48,397 --> 00:12:50,907
We're someone who were born in the organization.

8349
00:12:51,397 --> 00:12:54,047
We had to kill them one day or another.

8350
00:12:54,687 --> 00:12:57,237
In order to survive, we had...

8351
00:13:00,657 --> 00:13:02,617
...no choice but to do that.

8352
00:13:04,787 --> 00:13:06,117
We had no choice...

8353
00:13:08,957 --> 00:13:10,427
In the end...

8354
00:13:10,927 --> 00:13:13,147
...didn't we managed to survive.

8355
00:13:22,687 --> 00:13:23,667
So this is...

8356
00:13:24,647 --> 00:13:26,087
...the real you.

8357
00:13:27,387 --> 00:13:29,827
So that's how you lived a painful life,

8358
00:13:30,227 --> 00:13:33,397
while deceiving and contradicting yourself?

8359
00:13:33,897 --> 00:13:34,867
Shut up!

8360
00:13:34,947 --> 00:13:36,867
Just what can you understand?

8361
00:13:38,407 --> 00:13:40,987
You're right!
 I can't understand it.

8362
00:13:42,077 --> 00:13:42,617
But,

8363
00:13:45,827 --> 00:13:48,787
If you have no place to go, I can give you one.

8364
00:13:49,627 --> 00:13:51,877
I'll become your reason to live.

8365
00:13:52,707 --> 00:13:54,797
So stop deceiving yourself already.

8366
00:13:55,377 --> 00:13:56,967
I mean,

8367
00:13:58,767 --> 00:14:00,387
you've already crossed your path with me.

8368
00:14:09,097 --> 00:14:12,147
Can you hear me!? 
I won't let my comrade die.

8369
00:14:12,477 --> 00:14:15,527
That's why, I won't forgive you if you die!

8370
00:14:18,147 --> 00:14:19,277
What?!

8371
00:14:19,277 --> 00:14:21,527
Firing his lightning on himself?!

8372
00:14:22,737 --> 00:14:23,577
Look!

8373
00:14:24,537 --> 00:14:27,367
That black thing... has 
started dispersing from his body.

8374
00:14:32,457 --> 00:14:34,087
No, not yet!

8375
00:14:34,587 --> 00:14:36,497
Don't you dare die on me, Ja'far!

8376
00:15:06,447 --> 00:15:08,577
Hey, are you alive!?

8377
00:15:11,867 --> 00:15:12,707
Yeah.

8378
00:15:16,067 --> 00:15:17,667
God, you're always...

8379
00:15:22,647 --> 00:15:24,187
Unbelievable!

8380
00:15:24,687 --> 00:15:27,947
He saved a human who almost fell into depravity.

8381
00:15:28,407 --> 00:15:30,147
This guy is really...

8382
00:15:36,767 --> 00:15:38,527
This is the treasure room!

8383
00:15:38,847 --> 00:15:41,467
A place where it will be decided,

8384
00:15:41,587 --> 00:15:44,007
who will form a contract with the Djinn, Valefor.

8385
00:15:44,447 --> 00:15:47,577
Now, shall we decide who'll be the King?

8386
00:15:54,537 --> 00:15:56,457
Go... Sinbad!

8387
00:15:58,087 --> 00:15:58,917
Hina?

8388
00:15:59,667 --> 00:16:03,677
Everyone here, recognizes you as a King.

8389
00:16:09,137 --> 00:16:11,047
Now form the contract with the Djinn,

8390
00:16:11,567 --> 00:16:13,187
Our King!

8391
00:16:18,977 --> 00:16:22,687
I shall recognize you as my King!

