8570
00:16:42,417 --> 00:16:44,007
We came back, huh?

8571
00:16:44,717 --> 00:16:45,807
How strange...

8572
00:16:46,337 --> 00:16:49,177
It hasn't been long since I entered the Dungeon...

8573
00:16:49,847 --> 00:16:52,137
...and it still feels like an eternity.

8574
00:16:52,887 --> 00:16:54,597
Glad to see you came back.

8575
00:17:05,697 --> 00:17:06,567
Father!

8576
00:17:08,197 --> 00:17:08,907
I...

8577
00:17:10,867 --> 00:17:13,157
Now, let's head back to the village!

8578
00:17:13,537 --> 00:17:15,327
The coming of age ceremony is awaiting you.

8579
00:17:17,207 --> 00:17:19,207
I will excuse myself here.

8580
00:17:20,377 --> 00:17:21,537
Wait, Drakon!

8581
00:17:24,797 --> 00:17:27,547
In the first place, we're enemies.

8582
00:17:27,677 --> 00:17:30,257
We inevitably teamed up in the Dungeon,

8583
00:17:30,717 --> 00:17:33,727
but I have no reason to stay with you any longer.

8584
00:17:36,227 --> 00:17:37,387
What's with those eyes?

8585
00:17:37,387 --> 00:17:39,307
No, nothing really.

8586
00:17:41,187 --> 00:17:42,687
<i>He's not being honest with himself.</i>

8587
00:17:43,357 --> 00:17:46,447
Anyways, I'll return to the capital for now.

8588
00:17:46,697 --> 00:17:48,277
I know it's dangerous,

8589
00:17:48,777 --> 00:17:50,387
but still in that country,

8590
00:17:51,407 --> 00:17:53,627
I have someone that I must protect!

8591
00:17:55,997 --> 00:17:58,457
I see. Then, good luck!

8592
00:18:00,577 --> 00:18:02,957
I doubt we'll cross our paths ever again.

8593
00:18:11,507 --> 00:18:12,757
Sinbad...

8594
00:18:13,467 --> 00:18:15,687
If I was a free man,

8595
00:18:15,987 --> 00:18:17,687
I would've chosen you as my master...

8596
00:18:19,227 --> 00:18:21,267
No, I think I'll leave it at that.

8597
00:18:21,267 --> 00:18:24,147
With a lord like him, it'll be quite troublesome.

8598
00:18:27,187 --> 00:18:28,857
Household Vessels.

8599
00:18:28,857 --> 00:18:32,527
They are the people who're attracted to the 
King's Vessel chosen by a Djinn.

8600
00:18:33,157 --> 00:18:37,037
And the warriors, who share the Magoi of their King and the blessings of that Djinn.

8601
00:18:38,407 --> 00:18:42,537
Drakon, is the first to ever receive this power.

8602
00:18:43,457 --> 00:18:47,247
However, for him to actually use that power,

8603
00:18:47,447 --> 00:18:49,947
is something that will happen in near future.

8604
00:18:52,467 --> 00:18:54,427
Alright, let's head back!

8605
00:19:00,307 --> 00:19:04,187
O' you who has now become a 
proud warrior of Imuchakk.

8606
00:19:04,607 --> 00:19:08,527
Let's give you that symbol and your sacred name.

8607
00:19:08,897 --> 00:19:10,607
O' warrior stand here.

8608
00:19:15,777 --> 00:19:19,567
Rampaging Unicorn's fang and horn
 are the proof that you're a Warrior.

8609
00:19:20,077 --> 00:19:23,827
That indigo turban signifies the color of the sea.

8610
00:19:24,077 --> 00:19:28,127
And that design on them, 
represents the soul of Imuchakk itself.

8611
00:19:28,547 --> 00:19:31,087
The name of that warrior is, Hinahoho!

8612
00:19:33,967 --> 00:19:40,427
Your new name means, "Pure as the sea".

8613
00:19:40,627 --> 00:19:42,937
So become an honest warrior!

8614
00:19:42,937 --> 00:19:43,727
Yes!

8615
00:19:50,357 --> 00:19:51,357
Here.

8616
00:19:58,537 --> 00:19:59,737
Leader!

8617
00:20:00,117 --> 00:20:02,497
Cheers!

8618
00:20:04,457 --> 00:20:05,457
Father.

8619
00:20:08,297 --> 00:20:10,047
I mean, Dad.

8620
00:20:10,837 --> 00:20:12,587
I'll leave Imuchakk.

8621
00:20:13,507 --> 00:20:14,587
I have made up my mind.

8622
00:20:14,727 --> 00:20:18,137
Rather, my instincts end up acknowledging him.

8623
00:20:18,887 --> 00:20:20,167
I want to be his weapon,

8624
00:20:20,347 --> 00:20:21,307
his hands,

8625
00:20:21,467 --> 00:20:22,527
his shield,

8626
00:20:22,767 --> 00:20:24,527
and want to fulfill his wish.

8627
00:20:25,347 --> 00:20:26,927
I want to create a new world,

8628
00:20:27,107 --> 00:20:28,927
together with him!

8629
00:20:30,437 --> 00:20:33,107
That's what makes you a warrior of Imuchakk!

8630
00:20:33,697 --> 00:20:35,397
I am happy for you.

8631
00:20:49,207 --> 00:20:52,917
Capital of Imuchakk

8632
00:20:51,387 --> 00:20:52,927
Elder Chief, Rametoto-sama.

8633
00:20:53,507 --> 00:20:57,337
I thank you for giving me an audience today.

8634
00:20:59,347 --> 00:21:02,427
I'm present here to ask for your daughter 
Rurumu's hand for engagement and,

8635
00:21:03,097 --> 00:21:07,557
a long term leave from Imuchakk.

8636
00:21:08,357 --> 00:21:12,437
Just answer my one question, Warrior Hinahoho!

8637
00:21:13,147 --> 00:21:17,277
You... what can you give to my daughter?

8638
00:21:17,277 --> 00:21:19,367
Is it money or power perhaps?

8639
00:21:19,367 --> 00:21:20,657
Maybe land?

8640
00:21:20,657 --> 00:21:25,957
I've trained my daughter with every essential knowledge and made her a strong warrior.

8641
00:21:26,827 --> 00:21:29,287
She has everything, you know?

8642
00:21:29,837 --> 00:21:34,457
Just what can you give her, 
after becoming her husband?

8643
00:21:35,337 --> 00:21:39,307
There might be nothing
 I could give her right now.

8644
00:21:40,717 --> 00:21:45,637
Bastard, you dare show your pathetic appearance, in front of a head warrior like myself?

8645
00:21:45,637 --> 00:21:47,267
I'll mince you into pieces.

8646
00:21:49,857 --> 00:21:52,567
There might be nothing
 I could give her right now.

8647
00:21:53,277 --> 00:21:57,857
But, I can surely see and realize 
dreams together with her.

8648
00:21:58,527 --> 00:22:00,277
My master's dream!

8649
00:22:03,577 --> 00:22:05,947
With this conference, Sinbad closed the deal

8650
00:22:06,067 --> 00:22:10,127
on an official contract monopolizing
 Imuchakk's trade routes.

8651
00:22:11,247 --> 00:22:13,627
Conqueror Sinbad's name now
 spread across the world,

8652
00:22:13,627 --> 00:22:15,667
not only as an adventurer,

8653
00:22:15,667 --> 00:22:17,967
but also as a trader.

8654
00:22:18,467 --> 00:22:20,867
And the fleet he created,

8655
00:22:21,387 --> 00:22:25,687
started to gain fame as Sindria trade
 ships, in the near future.

8656
00:22:35,407 --> 00:22:38,287
It's because my face was boring

8657
00:22:35,407 --> 00:22:38,287
kagami ni utsuru jibun ga

8658
00:22:38,287 --> 00:22:41,207
that I was reflected in the mirror like that

8659
00:22:38,287 --> 00:22:41,207
saenai kao wo shiteta kara

8660
00:22:41,207 --> 00:22:44,047
The dream I saw of flying in the sky

8661
00:22:41,207 --> 00:22:44,047
kinou mita sora wo tobu yume

8662
00:22:44,047 --> 00:22:46,837
has now started flowing inside my eyes

8663
00:22:44,047 --> 00:22:46,837
hitomi no oku de ugokidasu

8664
00:22:46,837 --> 00:22:49,717
If only I had a bit of courage

8665
00:22:46,837 --> 00:22:49,717
sukoshi no yuuki ga arunara

8666
00:22:49,717 --> 00:22:52,677
I could've flown at anytime

8667
00:22:49,717 --> 00:22:52,677
itsudemo tobidaseru no ni

8668
00:22:52,677 --> 00:22:58,307
A breeze rushed across the shore

8669
00:22:52,677 --> 00:22:58,307
oounabara ni kaze ga fuiteta yo

8670
00:22:58,307 --> 00:23:03,187
If you stretch your hands

8671
00:22:58,307 --> 00:23:03,187
te wo hirogereba

8672
00:23:03,187 --> 00:23:12,617
A new world will connect

8673
00:23:03,187 --> 00:23:12,617
atarashii sekai ga tsunagaru

8674
00:23:15,327 --> 00:23:20,837
Grasp your body and soul together!

8675
00:23:15,327 --> 00:23:20,837
zenshinzenrei subete wo tsukamu yo!

8676
00:23:20,837 --> 00:23:26,757
There is a new born hope in my hands

8677
00:23:20,837 --> 00:23:26,757
boku no tenonaka ni wa umaretate no kibou

8678
00:23:26,757 --> 00:23:32,387
I wonder what you could see

8679
00:23:26,757 --> 00:23:32,387
habataku tsubasa so nosaki ni

8680
00:23:32,387 --> 00:23:38,227
across those wings of yours? Will I ever know?

8681
00:23:32,387 --> 00:23:38,227
nani ga mieru? wakaru darou

8682
00:23:38,227 --> 00:23:43,857
Together with these feelings of mine

8683
00:23:38,227 --> 00:23:43,857
takanaru kimochi tomo ni

8684
00:23:43,857 --> 00:23:52,907
Let's start our journey!

8685
00:23:43,857 --> 00:23:52,907
kono mama ima tabi ni de yo

